365 Auto Upload is a lightweight automation tool designed to streamline YouTube content publishing workflows. It helps creators and developers manage large volumes of video uploads, schedule content in advance, and maintain consistent channel activity with minimal manual effort.

The project focuses on automation, scalability, and testing, making it useful for:
YouTube content scheduling
Bulk video upload management
